[{"title":"送胡南石侍御巡按贵州","author":"陈子壮","text":"英僚除目冠台差，听唱东班即往谐。\n罗甸遥思持节入，都亭先见有轮埋。\n不辞敬梓批单疏，曾信安苗化两阶。\n是处叫天俱尺五，何言万里易阴霾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31252,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汪生洲左司马致仕将归授其先公诒燕图作歌多怀旧之感","author":"陈子壮","text":"詄荡天门乍可呼，明星摇动应中枢。\n勋名未蔽淩烟阁，都人看写二疏图。\n如此归装良已足，怀君念友衢山曲。\n缥缃只欲借留题，传示趋庭影数幅。\n展玩寻思踰十春，手泽音容粉墨新。\n一灯父子传经夜，补被寒温待试晨。\n斗升亦筮明廷对，看子成名仕不再。\n尔时清白畏人知，微言全谱忠经在。\n曾驱四牡遂遑将，曾奉疏恩到省郎。\n扶杖瞻天天尺五，陈筵爱日日初长。\n至今开图百感集，慈鸟时动皋鱼泣。\n身都九列不为卑，况望松楸胜赐级。\n荀陈两世称交游，长歏之子盛箕裘。\n蓼莪不共王褒听，恐入山阳笛里愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31253,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冯桢卿给谏为尊人青方新开园亭邀同卢本潜都谏过酌 其一","author":"陈子壮","text":"名园不羡辟疆同，青琐郎扶白发翁。\n盘上生蒲皆九节，花边调鹤似双童。\n干霄惯洒湖州墨，卜夜还谈碣石风。\n旧客肯教狂阮籍，独持清赏就王戎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31254,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冯桢卿给谏为尊人青方新开园亭邀同卢本潜都谏过酌 其二","author":"陈子壮","text":"韦曲花开即共娱，杜陵佳句不应孤。\n旧来好事今能否，中有高堂天下无。\n酒密歌长寒易借，□深树旷月全铺。\n愿逢直省多休暇，又度春风白玉壶。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31255,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为冯青方铭杖","author":"陈子壮","text":"七尺之筇，五尺之童。\n何以御之，老子犹龙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31256,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观黑帅还朝图有感","author":"陈子壮","text":"间关水草远如期，宛马长鸣识贰师。\n天子至今閒羽猎，上林秋雁弋书迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31257,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"何象冈相公邀赏洞梅即呈绝句","author":"陈子壮","text":"和月和烟尽一欢，一杯杯到不曾寒。\n要知京国春如许，为放梅龙小洞看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31258,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送刘瞻甫州守左补江西幕","author":"陈子壮","text":"多为军储费量筹，难辞摄县太仓州。\n西江听得吴侬语，紞鼓难鸣挽不留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31259,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望雪 其一","author":"陈子壮","text":"腊节将过雪不飞，四郊人暂曝晴晖。\n应龙久蛰雷收响，信尔丛坛合祷归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31260,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望雪 其二","author":"陈子壮","text":"天意曾回一日风，肯令三白笑田公。\n纷纷占繇知何准，南北阴阳讶许同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31261,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望雪 其三","author":"陈子壮","text":"爱惜含英玉一窠，露寒密暖底调和。\n寄书黄耳休惊吠，香雪罗浮望较多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31262,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"葛赠公专祀诗","author":"陈子壮","text":"人高乡月旦，俗下使輶轩。\n小学方今授，通儒自昔论。\n陔兰当节媚，林笋及冬温。\n让叔二分业，含甥一本恩。\n书翻孔氏壁，金掷管宁园。\n有道须旌辟，昵公绝奥援。\n诸生半鲁国，亚子直黄门。\n皋鹤声闻切，山龙献纳尊。\n移忠为谏草，于道即微言。\n晻霭扶风帐，青葱下马原。\n不忘深水木，每易荐蘅荪。\n今日灵光殿，依然汉独存。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31263,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"双塔","author":"陈子壮","text":"神岛丹邱若个边，西山云日净诸天。\n双藤仆仆巾车引，笑杀长安双塔悬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31264,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"灵济宫","author":"陈子壮","text":"只当元都一度馀，朝天宫在火烟墟。\n马蹄閒熟祈灵路，看演鸣鞭拜玉除。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31265,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花 其一","author":"陈子壮","text":"暖屋周遭静掩扉，故园蜂蝶到应稀。\n好风窗纸须吹碎，得任梅花作雪飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31266,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花 其二","author":"陈子壮","text":"自是佳人不可期，况随病骨强支离。\n今朝看著沈吟醉，年尾年头总未知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31267,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为顾珠岩给谏寿太夫人","author":"陈子壮","text":"自种忘忧色倍荣，俱分擎露到金茎。\n家筵易入江鱼荐，使节真回天马行。\n闺法元常彤管籍，薰修南岳碧桃笙。\n山龙衮职多需尔，问讯斑衣大笑迎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31268,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日道院奉和王师相","author":"陈子壮","text":"彻城车马剧，于此亦销忙。\n草色春侵院，松声晚韵房。\n玉壶将月贮，宝鼎合烟藏。\n即使山中相，还劳辟谷方。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31269,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"垂丝牡丹","author":"陈子壮","text":"下马金尊酒正匀，啼莺玉箸怨偏新。\n岂因夜雨多媒妒，揉碎宫前一片春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31270,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"亭上 其一","author":"陈子壮","text":"沙草连飞太白云，南征遥度水犀军。\n閒中一散机心事，留客楸枰过夜分。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31271,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"亭上 其二","author":"陈子壮","text":"不使钱刀计亦胜，床头无恙玉壶冰。\n近添饲鹤三升粟，更供慈元一盏灯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31272,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"亭上 其三","author":"陈子壮","text":"多谢侯门接植饶，海棠红药不禁飘。\n西邻树大东邻荫，雨燕风蝉暮复朝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31273,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送阮旭青给谏册封德藩归寿母","author":"陈子壮","text":"御仗朝随出掖垣，南宫簇簇动星轩。\n削圭帝子言无戏，如砺名山国永存。\n汉节一花明济岸，秦碑积雨洗天门。\n有怀正好歌来谂，得望扶桑引寿尊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31274,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别意 其一","author":"陈子壮","text":"三五流光亦可攀，玉笙清怨不消閒。\n一装好趁如云出，莫误鸡鸣急度关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31275,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别意 其二","author":"陈子壮","text":"只向官邮说短长。\n万条烟柳任游飏。\n未经暮雨拖巫峡，谁解猿声断客肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31276,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"携手曲","author":"陈子壮","text":"锦鸡唤红日，渌水绚青春。\n垂杨十馀里，楼閤不生尘。\n燕岁莺年遂相慕，鸦黄蛾绿新流顾。\n谁家女雏好娇啼，牵车为向华山度。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31277,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉赠乔年伯","author":"陈子壮","text":"过市每携游侠传，闭门长习度人经。\n已知报国凭时命，即论传家有典刑。\n闻道关南多虎迹，思君云表一鸿冥。\n黄钟若协阶符奏，吹到乔林百丈青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31278,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"部中杂咏十二首 其一 莺","author":"陈子壮","text":"岂自矜毛羽，穿飞亦鲜俦。\n生藏嘉树底，日有好音流。\n不省金丸惧，因辞宝瑟游。\n斋居偏觉汝，清啭若为留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31279,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"部中杂咏十二首 其二 蝉","author":"陈子壮","text":"感尔能幽响，如弦泛许长。\n大都吹玉露，一半溢清商。\n院敞风皆奏，人閒睡不妨。\n无嗤终抱木，亦足答晴光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31280,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"部中杂咏十二首 其三 槐","author":"陈子壮","text":"斧柯曾不试，新叶自纷纷。\n一碧何如水，层空只乱云。\n文书森过日，鸟雀晏为群。\n遮莫惊丝竹，箫韶习奏闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31281,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"部中杂咏十二首 其四 燕","author":"陈子壮","text":"主人看物候，往往寸心消。\n海燕将春色，年年一度遥。\n穿花时自喜，带雨即同飘。\n为忆张文献，吟诗鹰隼调。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31282,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"部中杂咏十二首 其五 鹤","author":"陈子壮","text":"翻连毛羽大，来自海天宽。\n启户双飞至，空阶独舞看。\n愿为君子赏，谱入素琴弹。\n别有唳清夜，相邀明月寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31283,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"部中杂咏十二首 其六","author":"陈子壮","text":"侧身终远俗，此地即长生。\n台上堪流顾，花时得漫行。\n乍高琪树影，新浣玉池明。\n多少恩光在，非同饮啄情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31284,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"部中杂咏十二首 其七 柏","author":"陈子壮","text":"双柏槎牙立，看成龙虎姿。\n香枝或见掇，苦干定谁移。\n山作将军号，春还老子祠。\n此间信时令，生理露霜披。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31285,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"部中杂咏十二首 其八 葵花","author":"陈子壮","text":"宿种多穿砌，高花动压林。\n枯荣会有族，萧艾本难侵。\n不用迂回照，争持径寸心。\n偶惊过夏半，色比故园深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31286,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"部中杂咏十二首 其九 井水甘洌人来汲皆曰礼部井云","author":"陈子壮","text":"神仙开古甃，风雨过閒亭。\n猿饮如相接，龙吟或可听。\n缕烟秋叶下，残梦石林醒。\n未必人间世，滔滔有浊泾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31287,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"部中杂咏十二首 其十","author":"陈子壮","text":"沙窝偏近地，新水引成槽。\n涓滴分消渴，阑干见二毛。\n赞皇差识别，桑苧未清高。\n窃有羸瓶虑，将无抱瓮劳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31288,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"部中杂咏十二首 其十一 紫薇花","author":"陈子壮","text":"紫府花临户，丹砂为结胎。\n轻盈能自艳，凌乱不胜开。\n岂以身沾著，都非意剪裁。\n舍人美诗句，书赐迩英来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31289,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"部中杂咏十二首 其十二 茉莉","author":"陈子壮","text":"乡园篱落物，珍异即倾都。\n三日香随席，前生顶上珠。\n却清炎热尽，可和雪霜无。\n消受南中载，风流汉大夫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31290,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"獐","author":"陈子壮","text":"风草能成性，平坡似绝峰。\n渐驯为撤栅，好养欲生茸。\n身践三清界，眠高百尺松。\n何当觅奔走，任此老閒踪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31291,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"榆半枯亦具古趣","author":"陈子壮","text":"昔贤论齐物，不碍养生如。\n祇是形容异，相看岁月除。\n风吹秦塞渺，星挂汉查虚。\n便倩黄痴笔，来添水石居。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31292,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庆翁寿图赞","author":"陈子壮","text":"曾到函关作吏来，史君原是谪仙才。\n鲈鱼蚤矣辞荣禄，玄豹悠然起寿杯。\n松菊几悬晴日艳，芝兰偏对好风开。\n只今紫气横天末，知是关前命驾回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31293,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"依韵答怀五弟","author":"陈子壮","text":"海烟来不近，三月意长悬。\n送喜灯花际，忘忧背树边。\n小人思击缶，中妇解安弦。\n江夏无双誉，何郎第五贤。\n玉麟传信早，金粟注生前。\n排浪挝铜鼓，飞花戏玉鞭。\n兴拖云外瀑，幽动竹间蝉。\n往恨消听雁，时名等逐膻。\n纵横迟六印，感慨系终篇。\n艳说东西廨，平居日月泉。\n有人闲伐桂，无土不舒莲。\n若论红颜在，修琴卖药年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31294,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宝月台","author":"陈子壮","text":"李白居南国，青山换九华。\n联诗在高壁，放酌出清涯。\n相对烟峦古，相悬江汉斜。\n盈盈有台月，长载洞中霞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31295,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉虚宫","author":"陈子壮","text":"矫健看人绝，飘摇定帝居。\n旋看天北界，不驻日南车。\n我意无行地，山形亦步虚。\n安知岑上岭，高穆数重馀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31296,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漱流石","author":"陈子壮","text":"兹山何太古，流水鸣其中。\n只闻孺子咏，不愧先生风。\n雨过一帆转，瀑飞众壑同。\n高啸相招隐，吾意在崆峒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31297,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与客泛舟浮邱 其一","author":"陈子壮","text":"乡国喧阗色，琴尊澹荡游。\n酌君五日酒，莫向楚江洲。\n浣态怜西子，诗情对惠休。\n烟堤人四望，何幸得同舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31298,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与客泛舟浮邱 其二","author":"陈子壮","text":"轻妆飘越苧，新曲按齐纨。\n素领桦皮箧，清宜竹箨冠。\n风花来往共，山水有无看。\n或是真龙子，双双故绕阑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31299,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与客泛舟浮邱 其三","author":"陈子壮","text":"江中千百舫，我辈选双舲。\n缁艳从分载，鸥凫又隔汀。\n浮家终有策，吊古恐无灵。\n不道虚长日，烟林火数星。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31300,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与客泛舟浮邱 其四","author":"陈子壮","text":"舵楼任极目，舟阵鹳鹅齐。\n标锦经花掷，宫罗倩醉题。\n灵潮千丈送，游旆五方迷。\n不仗缯符力，江城散鼓鼙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31301,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"云淙海曙楼","author":"陈子壮","text":"古艳新枝雪未齐，如云仙队访幽栖。\n冰心久领丹台秘，洞口曾留玉简题。\n歌笑一群俱木客，鸿濛尺五应天鸡。\n无辞止宿田家约，欲采芝英信杖藜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31302,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西樵大科峰","author":"陈子壮","text":"失却樵丘第几盘，狂飔吹动海天宽。\n只惊南国多回雁，谁解西风有驻鸾。\n村树半沉云咽响，客衣遥泛日分寒。\n怅齐小鲁何如此，消与吴阊疋练看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31303,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白云洞","author":"陈子壮","text":"信有金光窈窕迎，夹墀流濑自纵横。\n幽崖白日高寒斗，特地银河洒濯明。\n霜杵预知秋转急，天瓢还引醉同倾。\n新传水次餐花法，从写云中曳佩声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31304,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"碧玉洞","author":"陈子壮","text":"一踏双高气即苏，风雷谁与擘真图。\n讵论竹箭三门驶，尽遣螭龙绝壑徂。\n石窦秋深喧草木，海潮天落应虚无。\n题崖不记飞仙事，薄采空怜九节蒲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31305,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访何相君遥望榄山有作","author":"陈子壮","text":"若士相望海越宽，莫疑西涨有狂澜。\n蛟龙起处多成岛，日月分流并作滩。\n识面乍逢渔父问，轻身欲学水仙餐。\n前溪一曲閒情兴，暂采芙蓉报不难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31306,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"流溪曲 其一","author":"陈子壮","text":"遁甲雷文不是奇，游魂一鼓飒惊飔。\n将军自试摧妖剑，岂为杨村费出师。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31307,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"流溪曲 其二","author":"陈子壮","text":"四邑无辞转馈劳，东西夹阵将营高。\n省城一道流星报，郁峒钟渠夜半逃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31308,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"流溪曲 其三","author":"陈子壮","text":"新抽达舍解穿杨，埋伏才官虓莫当。\n耀山闪谷降旗动，落落生擒类犬羊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31309,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"流溪曲 其四","author":"陈子壮","text":"兰和峒口炮连珠，蓝粪山头烧欲无。\n兕甲昨编逃赋地，火耕今与散丁夫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31310,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"流溪曲 其五","author":"陈子壮","text":"羁縻亦是旧扶舆，割县多年妥服馀。\n解道行军陶布政，马场狮岭欲安如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31311,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经慧山游眺","author":"陈子壮","text":"梨谷梅林渴不清，顽然生意一瘿瓢。\n船轻坐稳吟秋水，为试山泉更度桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31312,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"枯树","author":"陈子壮","text":"金枝归何处，玉叶在谁家。\n老根曾愿死，誓不放春花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31313,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄逢永移寓山馆分赋六韵 其一","author":"陈子壮","text":"旧雨分锄地，初晴对暮天。\n敷林还积玉，置埒岂编钱。\n镜笑新花出，泉声暮鹊悬。\n已知尊足者，殊胜喜跫然。\n未老潜夫论，殊胜内景篇。\n从兹数晨夕，傍榻日高眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31314,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄逢永移寓山馆分赋六韵 其二","author":"陈子壮","text":"共怜秋气迫，飒雨荐新凉。\n逸兴池边墨，清言竹下觞。\n栖乌鸣汉影，别鹤叶庭霜。\n韦杜寻常会，壶尊遂一堂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31315,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠雷山人同谢将军游星岩","author":"陈子壮","text":"烟萝羽融寄沧洲，屦褐相逢剑气浮。\n玉帐谈棋新揖客，楼船下濑几防秋。\n因从绀阁空中啸，还觅丹梯世外游。\n正值好文多雅侣，天教石室有镌留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31316,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送黎遂球公车北上","author":"陈子壮","text":"易遣春风客思劳，花枝连日亚香槽。\n少年篷矢知谁敌，艳妇兰舟信所操。\n金谷从分锦步障，琵琶肯试郁轮袍。\n一竿投赠任公子，东第如今许钓鳌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31317,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"佚题","author":"陈子壮","text":"春晴不十日，亦自有春情。\n叠嶂来调骏，铺茵好试莺。\n兆年仙子穗，卜夜里人筝。\n相诗花林晓，翩其携手行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31318,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]